{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Eb]Holy, [Bb]holy, [Ab]holy, Holy [Bb7]isthe [Eb]Lord!
[Eb]Holy, [Bb]holy, [Ab]holy, [Bb7]Holy isour [Eb]God!
[Eb]He who always [Cm]liveth, [Bb7/D]Evermore [Eb/G]the [Bb]same
[Eb]Heav’n and earth Heruleth, [Ab]Come and [Bb7]praise His [Eb]name!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Eb]Holy, [Bb]holy, [Ab]holy, Holy [Bb7]is the [Eb]Lord!
[Eb]Holy, [Bb]holy, [Ab]holy, [Bb7]Holy is our [Eb]God!
[Eb]Glorious adn beloved [Fm]Is [Bb7/D]the One [Eb]adored!
[Eb]Holy, holy, [Ab]holy, Holy [Bb7]is the [Eb]Lord.
{end_of_verse}
